    "created_at": "2015-09-09T16:12:19Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-09-09T16:12:19Z",
    "body": "The HTML Standard should contain the default styling for ruby elements. CSS should just define how those styles are to be rendered. CSS should not define the look-and-feel of HTML markup though.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
